/Title (A high-performance advanced coagulant engineered for pulp and paper mill applications, designed to deliver efficient removal of suspended solids, colloidal matter, colour and other process contaminants from mill process water. The product is formulated to enhance the coagulation process by promoting rapid destabilization and aggregation of fine particles, resulting in faster separation and improved clarity of process water.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 929 0 R
/Next 942 0 R
>>
