948 0 obj
<<
/Title (An advanced starch-cooking additive engineered to enhance the strength performance of paper while simultaneously optimizing conventional starch consumption. The product is added directly into the starch cooking tank along with starch, prior to cooking, where it works within the starch system to enhance the strength contribution of the cooked starch to the paper sheet.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 934 0 R
/Next 956 0 R
>>
endobj
949 0 obj
<<
/Title (Depending on the process and application conditions, 500 g to 1 kg of product can potentially replace approximately 50 kg of conventional starch, offering a highly attractive opportunity for reducing starch consumption.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 934 0 R
/Prev 956 0 R
>>
endobj
